<title>USA: Ameritech, IBM to set up Illinois service center.</title>
<headline>Ameritech, IBM to set up Illinois service center.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ameritech Corp and International Business Machines Corp said Monday they have chosen the Chicago suburb of Arlington Heights as the site for their joint customer service center.</p>
<p>The center may employ as many as 800 people. Some 600 of the jobs created will be new positions, the companies said.</p>
<p>The companies agreed to jointly market voice, data and video managaged desktop services for businesses. The center will support customers of that alliance, they said.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
